[1m[38;5;231mHow should notifications be delivered to users?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mIn-app inbox first (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mBell icon, unread count, notification list. No external services, nothing to configure, no deliverability issues. [39m
     [38;5;246mEmail/push added later on the same event stream.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m In-app + email
     [38;5;246mAdds an email provider, templates, and unsubscribe handling from day one. Reaches people who aren't in the app; [39m
     [38;5;246mmeaningfully more infrastructure and a real background job story.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m In-app + web push
     [38;5;246mAdds a service worker, VAPID keys, and a browser permission prompt. Immediate and free to send, but browser-only [39m
     [38;5;246mand users often decline the prompt.[39m
  [38;5;246m4. Type something.[39m
